# manuscript_assets/ is a read-only discovery-pass bundle: 222 of its 224
# files are byte-identical copies of files already tracked elsewhere in this
# repo (verified by content hash against the current worktree and, for a
# handful, against git history at their source branch) -- reconstructible,
# not tracked here. The tarball is fully derived from the directory.
# Two files are genuinely unique (curated/annotated content not derivable
# from any single tracked source) and are tracked explicitly below despite
# living under this ignored directory.
manuscript_assets.tar.gz
manuscript_assets/*
!manuscript_assets/MANIFEST.md
!manuscript_assets/source/
manuscript_assets/source/*
!manuscript_assets/source/phaseC-decomp__SOURCE_EXCERPTS.md

# Gate A1 raw worker/batch telemetry rings (EBS-only; GATE_A1_REPORT.md and
# derived CSVs carry the numbers) -- archived to GitHub Release
results/analysis/t_a1_worker/**/*.bin

# Gate A2b setarch-regime raw telemetry rings + harness scratch state
# (EBS-only; GATE_A2B_SETARCH_REGIME.md and setarch_regime.csv carry the
# numbers that matter) -- large, reconstructible by rerunning the harness
results/analysis/t_a2b_setarch_regime/*.bin
results/analysis/t_a2b_setarch_regime/.last_*

# Task 4 cuFFT rerun on 5070 Ti: raw per-run telemetry rings (large,
# reconstructible by rerunning tests/t2_cufft_interleaved.sh -- the CSV and
# the eventual GATE_B6_TASK4 report carry the numbers that matter, same
# convention as cufft_interleaved/telemetry/ above)
results/phaseB2/cufft_interleaved_5070ti/telemetry/

# Gate B7: Phase C decomposition on 5070 Ti -- raw decomp ring dumps (large,
# reconstructible by rerunning tests/run_gatec1_decomp.sh /
# tests/t3_phasec_paired_wallclock.sh with RESULTS/OUT overridden -- the CSVs,
# .txt summaries, and GATE_B7_5070TI_PHASEC.md carry the numbers that matter,
# same convention as results/phaseC/*.bin above)
results/phaseC/decomp_5070ti/*.bin
results/phaseC/paired_wallclock_5070ti/decomp/*.bin
